sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Chat UI
    participant API as FastAPI /chat
    participant NLI as NL Interface
    participant CME as Context Memory
    participant LLM as Ollama llama3.2
    participant DB as SQLite

    U->>UI: "find my invoices"
    UI->>API: message + session_id
    API->>NLI: handle_message
    NLI->>LLM: classify (intent=search)
    NLI-->>API: 3 result files
    NLI->>CME: save turns with file ids
    CME->>DB: conversation_turns
    API-->>UI: results

    U->>UI: "open the second one"
    UI->>API: message + session_id
    API->>NLI: handle_message
    NLI->>CME: recent turns for the prompt
    CME->>DB: read turns
    NLI->>LLM: classify with conversation context
    LLM-->>NLI: intent=open, refers_to_previous
    NLI->>CME: resolve_reference (ordinal rule)
    CME-->>NLI: second file of the last results
    NLI->>CME: record_open (usage)
    NLI-->>API: open_path
    API-->>UI: open_path
    UI->>U: launches file via Tauri opener
